# Two activations of the {6} ability are two +X/+0 effects that add up (CR 611.2, 613.4c). On turn 5 Bot1 controls
# five Moxen, the enters Heartwood and a Black Lotus. The first activation (two Forests, three Moxen, the Heartwood) resolves with the
# Lotus still there: Moxen x5, Heartwood, Lotus and the new Heartwood is 8 artifacts, so Aerid Konstrari is 13/4. The second (the
# other two Moxen, the Lotus's three mana sacrificed as part of paying, and the new Heartwood) counts the first
# activation's token and not the sacrificed Lotus: the five Moxen and three Heartwoods is 8 again, so 21/4.

